{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204330/extras/75b17a27c75e078e783007c3d917cad5.poster.avif?t=1761725492\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204330/extras/75b17a27c75e078e783007c3d917cad5.webm?t=1761725492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204330/extras/75b17a27c75e078e783007c3d917cad5.mp4?t=1761725492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204330/extras/4a4f16713c89d281a6f2ff06bb5513fb.webp?t=1761725492\" width=615 height=35 /></span><br><br>In County of Fortune, a medieval city builder with a twist, your goal is to develop an entire county. Rather than constructing individual buildings, your focus is on founding entire settlements and overseeing their growth from small villages to bustling cities. Each settlement you develop contributes to the prosperity of the county, and your decisions will determine its long-term success.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204330/extras/4d464c75610d96817ad7e20effbc8819.poster.avif?t=1761725492\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204330/extras/4d464c75610d96817ad7e20effbc8819.webm?t=1761725492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204330/extras/109c65d7d94258e96ac059b7592b5e35.webp?t=1761725492\" width=614 height=28 /></span><br><br>The world of County of Fortune is vast, offering a variety of landscapes where different places yield different oportunities. From natural resource through places suitable for growing various products to large navigable rivers that provide excellent access to the rest of the map. Explore the possibilities and build a county that reflects the diversity of the land.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204330/extras/9a88fc9e22c9b97b523963936752b5ab.poster.avif?t=1761725492\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204330/extras/9a88fc9e22c9b97b523963936752b5ab.webm?t=1761725492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204330/extras/9a88fc9e22c9b97b523963936752b5ab.mp4?t=1761725492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204330/extras/4bb9cfb7d53242757a1318200638294a.webp?t=1761725492\" width=615 height=28 /></span><br><br>As your county expands, unique cultural traits emerge based on the characteristics you cultivate in each settlement. These traits influence how your communities develop, making every county region or even village distinct. Will you choose a unified county under a single culture or adapt your playstyle in each region to use strengths of different cultures?","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3204330?t=1761725492","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3204330?t=1761725492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204330/ce0e7d8e35b3e5d2cbf8cf5b0f349c8def8f1310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761725492","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.s